---

---

<section class="px-4 py-8 sm:py-20" style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #FAFAF9, rgba(94, 234, 212, 0.05));">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground sm:text-[30px]">Dlaczego Tripper?</h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits grid -->
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <!-- Benefit 1: Sparkles -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white p-6">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EEAD4]/20">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-primary"
          >
            <path
              d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"
            ></path>
            <path d="M20 3v4"></path>
            <path d="M22 5h-4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Plany tworzone przez AI</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Sztuczna inteligencja uwzględnia lokalne atrakcje, odległości i Twoje preferencje — nie musisz być ekspertem.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 2: UserCog -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white p-6">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EEAD4]/20">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-primary"
          >
            <circle cx="18" cy="15" r="3"></circle>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <path d="M10 15H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <path d="m21.7 16.4-.9-.3"></path>
            <path d="m15.2 13.9-.9-.3"></path>
            <path d="m16.6 18.7.3-.9"></path>
            <path d="m19.1 12.2.3-.9"></path>
            <path d="m19.6 18.7-.4-1"></path>
            <path d="m16.8 12.3-.4-1"></path>
            <path d="m14.3 16.6 1-.4"></path>
            <path d="m20.7 13.8 1-.4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Spersonalizowane pod Ciebie</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Zapisz swoje preferencje podróżnicze i używaj ich wielokrotnie. Każdy plan jest inny, bo Ty jesteś wyjątkowy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 3: Pencil -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white p-6">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EEAD4]/20">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-primary"
          >
            <path
              d="M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z"
            ></path>
            <path d="m15 5 4 4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Pełna kontrola nad planem</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Edytuj, przenoś, dodawaj — AI daje propozycję, ale to Ty decydujesz o ostatecznym kształcie wycieczki.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Benefit 4: Smartphone -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white p-6">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#5EEAD4]/20">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-primary"
          >
            <rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <path d="M12 18h.01"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-foreground">Dostępny zawsze i wszędzie</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
          Twoje plany są bezpiecznie zapisane w chmurze. Otwórz je na telefonie w podróży, kiedy ich potrzebujesz.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
